      "reason": "sosta means parking; 'stopping place' is not the right term",
      "changes": {
        "en": {
          "before": "Under Regulation (EC) No 561/2006, a driver may exceed four and a half hours of driving to reach a suitable stopping place for vehicle security, provided road safety is not compromised.",
